1
00:02:04,500 --> 00:02:05,900
No!

2
00:02:28,640 --> 00:02:30,040
No!

3
00:03:10,880 --> 00:03:12,780
You're kidding me.

4
00:03:16,420 --> 00:03:18,720
My next punch will end this.

5
00:03:18,920 --> 00:03:19,760
Get ready!

6
00:03:22,260 --> 00:03:23,660
Ahhhh!

7
00:03:26,700 --> 00:03:28,100
Ahhhh!

8
00:03:34,240 --> 00:03:35,070
Huh?

9
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:38,960
Ahhhh!

10
00:03:42,660 --> 00:03:44,500
Ahhhhhh! Ahhhhhh!

11
00:03:57,900 --> 00:03:59,057
Wait, what happened?

12
00:03:59,140 --> 00:04:01,077
When did he get heads?

13
00:04:01,160 --> 00:04:05,497
Nobody hit him at all—it's a side effect
of that cannonball form of his now.

14
00:04:05,580 --> 00:04:10,237
For the next 10 minutes or so, you can't
use any hockey—that's how it works!

15
00:04:10,320 --> 00:04:12,780
it works All that power comes at a cost.

16
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:15,412
But it looks like a good trade-off to me.

17
00:04:15,660 --> 00:04:18,017
Those punches really
did a number on Kaido.

18
00:04:18,100 --> 00:04:20,400
It's our chance to finish him off!

19
00:04:25,640 --> 00:04:29,180
You little oafs are pushing
your luck again, I see!

20
00:04:36,860 --> 00:04:37,920
Come on, Lupi.

21
00:04:38,100 --> 00:04:39,865
If you don't move, you'll die!

22
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:45,320
That was fast.

23
00:04:45,740 --> 00:04:46,920
Worn out already.

24
00:04:47,300 --> 00:04:49,760
Well, it was a lovely rampage.

25
00:04:50,500 --> 00:04:53,960
But all good things must
come to an end, as they say.

26
00:04:55,260 --> 00:04:56,600
Happy Mother's Day!

27
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:04,740
Now, hand over, saw hat, or get burnt!

28
00:05:08,760 --> 00:05:09,840
Counter-shock!

29
00:05:17,280 --> 00:05:19,000
Luffy, wake up!

30
00:05:30,100 --> 00:05:34,620
Come on, killer, we gotta keep the
pressure on him! Let's go! Roger!

31
00:06:09,260 --> 00:06:10,197
Kill her!

32
00:06:10,280 --> 00:06:11,700
Brace yourself!

33
00:06:29,280 --> 00:06:33,840
The wind that blows from the
heavens shall rend the land asunder!

34
00:06:34,540 --> 00:06:36,200
Dragon Twister!

35
00:06:40,280 --> 00:06:41,940
Kill her!

36
00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:51,520
This is ridiculous.

37
00:06:52,140 --> 00:06:54,846
That's our second natural
disaster in one day.

38
00:06:57,160 --> 00:07:00,080
Zoro, you saved me.

39
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:01,640
Of course.

40
00:07:15,700 --> 00:07:16,530
Luffy!

41
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:31,200
Hey, you big lizard!

42
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:35,892
You got another thing coming if you
think I'm gonna let you eat my captain!

43
00:08:00,140 --> 00:08:02,980
Oh, my God.

44
00:08:21,280 --> 00:08:25,120
There it is again, that strange Haki.

45
00:08:25,600 --> 00:08:27,776
I can sense it coming from his blade.

46
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:49,540
Three-Sword Style, Black
Rope, Dragon Quister!

47
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:06,140
He cut his scales!

48
00:09:12,820 --> 00:09:14,460
Oh, good look at that!

49
00:09:14,680 --> 00:09:16,380
That little punk hurt Kaido!

50
00:09:20,840 --> 00:09:22,720
This pain is familiar.

51
00:09:24,280 --> 00:09:25,400
I see.

52
00:09:25,780 --> 00:09:28,200
It seems my suspicions were correct.

53
00:09:31,080 --> 00:09:34,360
How did you end up with Odin's blade?

54
00:09:40,620 --> 00:09:44,480
You think your dragon
twister can stand up to mine?

55
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:47,480
You need to learn your place.

56
00:10:04,580 --> 00:10:06,260
Hey, come on, Murphy.

57
00:10:06,920 --> 00:10:08,680
Laura, is that you?

58
00:10:13,320 --> 00:10:15,980
We've got another big one coming!

59
00:10:24,220 --> 00:10:25,577
Dragon Twister!

60
00:10:25,660 --> 00:10:27,700
Demolition Dust!

61
00:11:05,920 --> 00:11:07,440
What a mess.

62
00:11:08,180 --> 00:11:10,100
What a mess.

63
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:24,360
This evening has not gone as planned.

64
00:11:24,760 --> 00:11:27,397
Our supplier getting
beheaded was bad enough.

65
00:11:27,480 --> 00:11:30,539
But now the entire banquet
has become a battlefield.

66
00:11:37,700 --> 00:11:42,920
seems to be an act of vengeance in the
name of a ruler who died 20 years ago

67
00:11:44,840 --> 00:11:47,717
wano's history aside this
shouldn't come as a surprise

68
00:11:47,800 --> 00:11:50,817
the moment that doflamingo
fell from power a clash

69
00:11:50,900 --> 00:11:53,557
between kaido and the worst
generation became inevitable

70
00:11:53,640 --> 00:11:57,517
and now we're dealing with
the perfect storm only fate

71
00:11:57,600 --> 00:11:59,937
could bring the samurai and
pirates together at a time

72
00:12:00,020 --> 00:12:04,937
like this soon right before
our eyes the world will

73
00:12:05,020 --> 00:12:09,657
be turned on its head it's
unlikely but think of what

74
00:12:09,740 --> 00:12:12,858
would happen if both emperors
were taken down at once

75
00:12:16,620 --> 00:12:19,880
It would be chaos impossible to predict

76
00:12:23,240 --> 00:12:26,340
But we need not worry about that

77
00:12:29,960 --> 00:12:33,560
The invaders are here and
their numbers are clear

78
00:12:34,920 --> 00:12:38,160
Fifty-four hundred or something near

79
00:12:39,880 --> 00:12:42,320
Minus the four hundred dead, I fear

80
00:12:45,760 --> 00:12:47,900
How did we fare, you say?

81
00:12:48,360 --> 00:12:51,600
Beast pirates are surely winning the day.

82
00:12:53,140 --> 00:12:59,680
30,000 have entered the fray,
but 3,000 are dead to our dismay.

83
00:13:00,180 --> 00:13:03,160
I must say, the samurai did a fine job.

84
00:13:06,140 --> 00:13:08,217
Because of their difference in numbers,

85
00:13:08,300 --> 00:13:11,594
they couldn't even reach Kaido
if they attacked head-on.

86
00:13:12,600 --> 00:13:16,357
Deciding to launch a surprise assault
was surely the correct choice.

87
00:13:16,440 --> 00:13:18,497
It was their only choice.

88
00:13:18,580 --> 00:13:22,580
But this battle won't end even
if they take Kaido's head!

89
00:13:24,860 --> 00:13:26,937
This is an Alto war.

90
00:13:27,020 --> 00:13:29,160
There's no refuge on the island.

91
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:32,417
Kaido's officers are absurdly powerful.

92
00:13:32,500 --> 00:13:35,237
If they don't finish them off as well,

93
00:13:35,320 --> 00:13:38,800
they'll butcher the
samurai 100 men at a time?

94
00:13:39,440 --> 00:13:42,077
It's up to the worst
generation to defeat them.

95
00:13:42,160 --> 00:13:43,520
No one else can do it.

96
00:13:44,480 --> 00:13:49,040
Otherwise, this game of Go will
end with a board full of black.

97
00:13:52,100 --> 00:13:55,140
It's too early to say
which side will prevail.

98
00:13:58,700 --> 00:14:04,740
Do your best to kill each
other, you filthy pirates.

99
00:14:20,460 --> 00:14:23,057
What the hell did he transform?

100
00:14:23,140 --> 00:14:25,237
That must be his man—beast form!

101
00:14:25,320 --> 00:14:27,237
I'll be damned in.

102
00:14:27,320 --> 00:14:29,717
Then I gotta admit this is fun!

103
00:14:29,800 --> 00:14:36,417
Took the words right
out of my mouth—you've?

104
00:14:36,500 --> 00:14:39,441
mouth you've You've really
thrown quite the party!

105
00:14:39,960 --> 00:14:40,790
Nooo!

106
00:14:44,800 --> 00:14:45,630
KIDEL!

107
00:14:49,100 --> 00:14:50,460
Listen up, everyone!

108
00:14:55,180 --> 00:14:59,520
To break the deadlock, Master Queen
entrusted me with a secret weapon.

109
00:14:59,760 --> 00:15:02,819
Something to leave the enemy
quaking in their boots.

110
00:15:05,520 --> 00:15:06,350
Yay!

111
00:15:06,433 --> 00:15:09,157
And might I say, you're looking as
majestic as ever, General Speed.

112
00:15:09,240 --> 00:15:10,420
Okay, sounds great.

113
00:15:10,620 --> 00:15:11,657
Where's the weapon, though?

114
00:15:11,740 --> 00:15:13,600
Why, it's right here.

115
00:15:14,240 --> 00:15:17,860
My skin shimmers like the sun. Flawless.

116
00:15:18,020 --> 00:15:19,480
As resilient as iron.

117
00:15:19,720 --> 00:15:22,860
And my muscles, they pulse with strength!

118
00:15:23,260 --> 00:15:24,240
You want one?

119
00:15:25,220 --> 00:15:26,400
Whoa! Incredible!

120
00:15:27,320 --> 00:15:31,380
You know, that's starting
to look real good to me.

121
00:15:34,600 --> 00:15:36,620
I need that dumpling now!

122
00:15:36,960 --> 00:15:38,400
Fuck it over, damn you!

123
00:15:40,740 --> 00:15:43,497
Seems like you've suffered
quite the loss, Briscola.

124
00:15:43,580 --> 00:15:44,410
What happened?

125
00:15:44,500 --> 00:15:45,441
Never mind that.

126
00:15:45,780 --> 00:15:49,440
The point is, I gotta get my
revenge on the Straw Hats.

127
00:15:49,620 --> 00:15:54,502
And if it takes this miracle dumpling of
yours to do that, then put it in my mouth!

128
00:15:57,840 --> 00:16:01,237
Far be it from me to stop you
once you eat one of these.

129
00:16:01,320 --> 00:16:04,517
Your whole world will change here.

130
00:16:04,600 --> 00:16:10,157
Well, how is it?

131
00:16:10,240 --> 00:16:11,317
General, hmm,

132
00:16:11,400 --> 00:16:17,757
feels like it might be working
or it might not be working.

133
00:16:17,840 --> 00:16:20,137
What a load of nonsense!

134
00:16:20,220 --> 00:16:24,237
Don't you know this ability
enhancing dumpling is

135
00:16:24,320 --> 00:16:27,057
a masterpiece made by none
other than master queen?

136
00:16:27,140 --> 00:16:30,137
Surely you're not saying it's a failure?

137
00:16:30,220 --> 00:16:33,337
Perhaps you'd like to tell him in person.

138
00:16:33,420 --> 00:16:40,420
Yeah,

139
00:16:40,940 --> 00:16:45,197
I feel it now.

140
00:16:45,280 --> 00:16:49,237
Suddenly a surge of power is.

141
00:16:49,320 --> 00:16:50,860
coursing through my veins!

142
00:16:54,440 --> 00:16:55,420
That's awesome!

143
00:16:55,760 --> 00:16:57,407
Oh, I gotta get me one, too!

144
00:17:00,840 --> 00:17:01,760
General speed!

145
00:17:02,060 --> 00:17:04,297
May I have a doubling too, pretty please?

146
00:17:04,380 --> 00:17:05,400
And one for me!

147
00:17:05,620 --> 00:17:06,500
Two for us!

148
00:17:06,940 --> 00:17:08,160
No need to fear!

149
00:17:09,260 --> 00:17:11,460
I have enough for all gifters!

150
00:17:11,880 --> 00:17:12,840
Help yourselves!

151
00:17:13,500 --> 00:17:14,330
Hooray!

152
00:17:15,740 --> 00:17:16,570
Ah, oh!

153
00:17:16,653 --> 00:17:17,483
Mm-hmm.

154
00:17:20,040 --> 00:17:20,870
Delicious!

155
00:17:21,580 --> 00:17:24,817
As soon as you finish eating,
get ready to join the battle.

156
00:17:24,900 --> 00:17:26,665
We can't afford to waste time.

157
00:17:26,860 --> 00:17:28,797
The Straw Hats are giving their best.

158
00:17:28,880 --> 00:17:30,320
We have to do the same.

159
00:17:36,500 --> 00:17:38,580
Risa-Lina, I wanna go!

160
00:17:38,900 --> 00:17:41,280
I wanna go to Onigashima with everyone!

161
00:17:42,160 --> 00:17:44,557
And I don't blame them
for leaving me behind.

162
00:17:44,640 --> 00:17:49,257
Even if it makes me sad, so please—he,

163
00:17:49,340 --> 00:17:52,817
what that frown off your face, master!

164
00:17:52,900 --> 00:17:53,730
master

165
00:18:14,640 --> 00:18:15,920
Keep me down!

166
00:18:23,220 --> 00:18:25,540
Keep me down!

167
00:18:27,480 --> 00:18:29,140
That's enough, Master.

168
00:18:29,760 --> 00:18:30,660
Please stop.

169
00:18:30,880 --> 00:18:32,586
You need to rest and recover.

170
00:18:34,480 --> 00:18:35,860
I'm okay.

171
00:18:36,760 --> 00:18:38,880
I can't buy Kaido myself.

172
00:18:39,520 --> 00:18:41,720
This is the only way I can help.

173
00:18:42,720 --> 00:18:43,700
I'm okay!

174
00:18:44,100 --> 00:18:47,571
I have to be okay and I have
to be brave enough to do this!

175
00:18:47,820 --> 00:18:50,000
This is the future of my country too!

176
00:18:50,320 --> 00:18:52,400
A future without Kaido and Odoji!

177
00:18:53,020 --> 00:18:54,860
That's worth fighting for!

178
00:18:57,440 --> 00:19:01,300
I mean, I can't be hungry
for the rest of my life.

179
00:19:01,520 --> 00:19:04,260
I want to eat real food whenever I want.

180
00:19:05,640 --> 00:19:06,740
I understand.

181
00:19:07,200 --> 00:19:08,553
We're here to help you!

182
00:19:08,840 --> 00:19:10,020
Yeah, don't worry!

183
00:19:10,840 --> 00:19:14,840
Let's have a meal first then hide
and wait for our chance to strike

184
00:19:40,020 --> 00:19:42,902
That's right, my fellow
gifters, eat them all up!

185
00:19:45,180 --> 00:19:46,080
Hey, look!

186
00:19:46,300 --> 00:19:49,200
I think that's Difugo,
the vice warden from Udon!

187
00:19:49,440 --> 00:19:50,280
You're dead!

188
00:19:50,740 --> 00:19:54,077
I'm gonna pay you back for all
the suffering you caused us!

189
00:19:54,160 --> 00:19:55,513
Sorry about that, guys.

190
00:19:55,720 --> 00:19:58,157
Can we call it water
under the bridge for now?

191
00:19:58,240 --> 00:19:59,700
What? Watch out!

192
00:20:01,500 --> 00:20:02,940
General Difugo, sir!

193
00:20:03,420 --> 00:20:04,560
Pleased to see you!

194
00:20:05,040 --> 00:20:09,460
Thank you, but let's cut the
formalities. Eat this! Eat this!

195
00:20:10,020 --> 00:20:10,980
Eat this!

196
00:20:12,000 --> 00:20:13,400
Eat this!

197
00:20:13,700 --> 00:20:16,420
Now serve the master and serve her well!

198
00:20:22,860 --> 00:20:23,700
General!

199
00:20:24,460 --> 00:20:25,290
General!

200
00:20:43,660 --> 00:20:44,490
Whoa!

201
00:20:44,573 --> 00:20:45,869
Boy, where that came from!

202
00:20:48,140 --> 00:20:48,970
Whoa!

203
00:20:51,980 --> 00:20:53,862
I can't believe what I just saw!

204
00:21:00,840 --> 00:21:01,781
This is the end!

205
00:21:05,200 --> 00:21:08,280
Hold down the robot and don't let go!

206
00:21:14,400 --> 00:21:15,760
Hey, that's cheating.

207
00:21:16,100 --> 00:21:17,982
I can't win with you guys on me.

208
00:21:19,240 --> 00:21:21,780
Yeah, that's the idea, you big metal dope.

209
00:21:22,020 --> 00:21:25,177
You may be tough, but there's no
way you can shake off all of us.

210
00:21:25,260 --> 00:21:26,613
Don't underestimate us.

211
00:21:26,720 --> 00:21:29,132
We're all gifters with superhuman powers.

212
00:21:29,380 --> 00:21:31,027
We got you locked down, pal.

213
00:21:34,380 --> 00:21:36,040
Oh, he's right.

214
00:21:36,220 --> 00:21:37,573
They're strong as hell.

215
00:21:42,080 --> 00:21:42,910
Uh...

216
00:21:45,140 --> 00:21:45,970
Franky!

217
00:21:46,900 --> 00:21:47,730
Huh?

218
00:21:47,813 --> 00:21:48,643
That sounds like...

219
00:21:48,726 --> 00:21:50,160
Usa! Nami!

220
00:21:51,100 --> 00:21:51,930
Agotama!

221
00:21:52,013 --> 00:21:52,843
Why are you here?

222
00:21:53,220 --> 00:21:54,520
Actually, never mind.

223
00:21:54,700 --> 00:21:56,417
I'm kind of in a pinch right now.

224
00:21:56,500 --> 00:21:57,817
Can you guys help me out here?

225
00:21:57,900 --> 00:22:00,800
I got all these dudes
piled up on me, and...

226
00:22:03,260 --> 00:22:04,090
Huh?

227
00:22:08,080 --> 00:22:08,997
Help us!

228
00:22:09,080 --> 00:22:10,460
Brave me!

229
00:22:13,100 --> 00:22:15,200
Geez, they got it worse than me!

230
00:22:16,420 --> 00:22:18,126
They actually scratched that!

231
00:22:18,340 --> 00:22:20,040
Now I'm in double trouble!

232
00:22:21,520 --> 00:22:23,597
Gifters, keep doing what you're doing!

233
00:22:23,680 --> 00:22:24,798
Block their escape!

234
00:22:25,300 --> 00:22:27,720
Now do you see how outnumbered you are?

235
00:22:27,840 --> 00:22:29,100
Even if you win here,

236
00:22:29,200 --> 00:22:33,037
you'd have to turn the tide all
across the island to stand a chance!

237
00:22:33,120 --> 00:22:35,040
Oh crap, I'm so screwed!

238
00:22:37,300 --> 00:22:38,200
That's right!

239
00:22:39,080 --> 00:22:43,198
I came here to turn the tide, and
that's exactly what I'm going to do!

240
00:22:48,380 --> 00:22:49,620
Hey, you guys!

241
00:22:49,860 --> 00:22:50,720
Listen up!

242
00:22:51,260 --> 00:22:53,080
Go help Rondo's stake!

243
00:22:53,700 --> 00:22:56,340
Son-Hack-Breeeek!

244
00:22:58,360 --> 00:23:00,560
You got it, bastard!

245
00:23:02,280 --> 00:23:03,110
What?

246
00:23:10,140 --> 00:23:11,420
Ugh, okay then.

247
00:23:16,920 --> 00:23:19,040
Tang, you nearly busted me up!

248
00:23:20,660 --> 00:23:21,490
Don't touch!

249
00:23:21,573 --> 00:23:23,260
I found my face again!

250
00:23:27,220 --> 00:23:29,749
What do you think you're
doing, you idiots?

251
00:23:30,520 --> 00:23:31,350
Sasaki!

252
00:23:32,480 --> 00:23:33,780
That's one, ulti!

253
00:23:33,980 --> 00:23:35,077
What the hell is going on?

254
00:23:35,160 --> 00:23:37,042
Switch over to the enemy's side!

255
00:23:37,200 --> 00:23:38,671
Strike the bastards down!

256
00:23:39,080 --> 00:23:39,920
They did what?

257
00:23:40,340 --> 00:23:41,399
But we're winning!

258
00:23:41,760 --> 00:23:44,878
What do they have to gain
by siding with the samurai?

259
00:23:44,980 --> 00:23:48,037
They're probably using some
stupid Devil Fruit power!

260
00:23:48,120 --> 00:23:49,600
You guys are the worst!

261
00:23:50,000 --> 00:23:53,537
You're begging for a headbutt,
and I've got plenty to go around!

262
00:23:53,620 --> 00:23:54,980
Can't take a hint, huh?

263
00:23:55,180 --> 00:23:56,827
Here's your lightning alert!

264
00:23:58,320 --> 00:24:02,026
This might put you into cardiac
arrest, so good luck with that!

265
00:24:02,340 --> 00:24:03,480
Thunder win!

266
00:24:04,460 --> 00:24:05,290
Go! Go!

267
00:24:07,340 --> 00:24:08,400
Fix this!

268
00:24:12,360 --> 00:24:13,540
That sucked.

269
00:24:13,740 --> 00:24:14,780
I can't move.

270
00:24:16,180 --> 00:24:19,360
You're getting double the
headbutts next time, bitch!

271
00:24:22,100 --> 00:24:24,257
I had a feeling that wouldn't be enough.

272
00:24:24,340 --> 00:24:27,057
Looks like I need more powerful
lightning to finish the job.

273
00:24:27,140 --> 00:24:29,260
You think you're pretty tricky, huh?

274
00:24:29,780 --> 00:24:31,898
Take those pirates down immediately.

275
00:24:32,280 --> 00:24:34,515
This could get ugly if we let them go.

276
00:24:34,860 --> 00:24:36,540
Aye aye, Sasaki sir!

277
00:24:36,920 --> 00:24:37,980
I got this!

278
00:24:42,400 --> 00:24:43,240
Dumpling star!

279
00:24:44,460 --> 00:24:46,340
What did I just swallow?

280
00:24:46,760 --> 00:24:48,040
Hey, everybody!

281
00:24:48,740 --> 00:24:50,320
We're friends now!

282
00:24:50,480 --> 00:24:51,460
Follow me!

283
00:24:56,860 --> 00:24:57,880
Aye aye, Master!

284
00:25:03,380 --> 00:25:07,700
What the hell, did the whole
armor division just turn on me?

285
00:25:08,000 --> 00:25:10,420
Hey, get back here, dammit!

286
00:25:10,620 --> 00:25:11,640
Careful, Pa.

287
00:25:12,840 --> 00:25:15,000
You're still in a fight, remember?

288
00:25:15,720 --> 00:25:17,300
Better pay attention.

289
00:25:24,920 --> 00:25:26,760
Or I'm gonna wreck ya.

290
00:25:28,560 --> 00:25:31,360
Franken-sword!

291
00:25:37,420 --> 00:25:39,880
Leave for victory!

292
00:25:54,680 --> 00:25:57,480
Damn it.

293
00:26:00,380 --> 00:26:02,417
What the hell did you do to me?

294
00:26:02,500 --> 00:26:05,577
The fun's over; I'm not
playing games with you.

295
00:26:05,660 --> 00:26:07,960
Be a good boy, black leg.

296
00:26:10,140 --> 00:26:11,337
What a pity?

297
00:26:11,420 --> 00:26:15,097
I wish I could have
teased you all night long.

298
00:26:15,180 --> 00:26:18,277
You're powerless against us.

299
00:26:18,360 --> 00:26:22,437
You took down so many men
without a hint of mercy,

300
00:26:22,520 --> 00:26:26,377
but before women like us,
you won't lift a finger.

301
00:26:26,460 --> 00:26:30,020
Your sad little life is
in the palm of my hand.

302
00:26:30,340 --> 00:26:32,480
I could end it in an instant.

303
00:26:35,420 --> 00:26:37,240
Now do as I say.

304
00:26:37,760 --> 00:26:39,600
Call for Nico Robin.

305
00:26:42,640 --> 00:26:44,464
Cayman lady here will help you.

306
00:26:49,500 --> 00:26:52,080
All you have to do is speak loudly to her.

307
00:26:52,300 --> 00:26:55,476
Then your words will be
transmitted across the castle.

308
00:26:55,840 --> 00:26:57,958
Well, do that and I'll set you free.

309
00:26:58,860 --> 00:27:01,440
That's a rare mercy from Kaido himself.

310
00:27:02,560 --> 00:27:03,980
And what if I do?

311
00:27:04,640 --> 00:27:06,000
What'll you do to her?

312
00:27:07,620 --> 00:27:08,580
Let's see.

313
00:27:09,440 --> 00:27:12,000
Me and my girls will
ambush her, of course.

314
00:27:12,420 --> 00:27:15,480
Then maim her arms and legs
so she can never escape.

315
00:27:16,480 --> 00:27:17,880
But don't worry.

316
00:27:18,080 --> 00:27:20,997
The mission we need her help for
could take years to complete.

317
00:27:21,080 --> 00:27:22,640
So we won't kill her.

318
00:27:23,340 --> 00:27:24,520
Not right away.

319
00:27:29,420 --> 00:27:32,720
Trust me, she won't make
it that easy for you.

320
00:27:33,820 --> 00:27:35,220
I found them!

321
00:27:35,420 --> 00:27:36,320
I found them!

322
00:27:36,680 --> 00:27:38,580
It's the Akazaya Samurai!

323
00:27:39,100 --> 00:27:40,820
They couldn't hide from me!

324
00:27:45,340 --> 00:27:50,320
Like I thought, they got away
from the rooftop, but guess what?

325
00:27:50,580 --> 00:27:52,620
They're covered in blood!

326
00:27:55,180 --> 00:27:59,200
And are they still alive? Yes! Barely.

327
00:27:59,320 --> 00:28:01,597
They're at the back of the castle tower!

328
00:28:01,680 --> 00:28:02,980
Go, go, go!

329
00:28:03,740 --> 00:28:08,020
The second floor of the treasure
repository at the second Fall!

330
00:28:08,380 --> 00:28:10,380
They must have escaped from Kaido.

331
00:28:10,940 --> 00:28:12,234
Someone else handling.

332
00:28:12,380 --> 00:28:13,640
I'm busy now.

333
00:28:14,620 --> 00:28:19,208
Get to the treasure repository immediately
and finish off the Akazaya Samurai.

334
00:28:19,780 --> 00:28:21,540
What is your answer, my lady?

335
00:28:22,540 --> 00:28:29,077
yes king of course i'll go there
shortly the treasure repository is near

336
00:28:29,160 --> 00:28:34,177
here i'll settle the matter in no
time once i finish administering some

337
00:28:34,260 --> 00:28:36,837
discipline just get the job done

338
00:28:36,920 --> 00:28:42,377
Kin'emon they lost wait don't go hey just

339
00:28:42,460 --> 00:28:48,380
so you know there's 10 people in that
room careful it's so It's so dark,

340
00:28:48,520 --> 00:28:49,814
I can't see very well,

341
00:28:49,960 --> 00:28:53,760
but there's one extra
person helping the samurai.

342
00:28:54,120 --> 00:28:57,560
Don't know who, but kill
them too while you're at it.

343
00:28:58,380 --> 00:29:01,220
Someone's in there, but who?
